    "poang": "0/2/0",
    "t": "<p>Beräkna \\(\\sum_{k=1}^{9}k^2\\).</p>",
    "s": "<p>Använd \\(\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^{n}k^2=\\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}6\\).</p><p>\\[\\sum_{k=1}^{9}k^2=\\frac{9\\cdot10\\cdot19}{6}=285.\\]</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> 285.</p>",
