    "s": "<p>\\(\\dfrac{\\binom63}{\\binom73}=\\dfrac{20}{35}=\\dfrac47\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac{4}{7}\\approx0{,}571\\), alltså cirka \\(57{,}1\\,\\%\\)</p>",
