        "s": "<p>\\(\\binom{13}{10}\\left(\\tfrac13\\right)^{10}\\left(\\tfrac23\\right)^3=\\dfrac{286\\cdot8}{1\\,594\\,323}=\\dfrac{2\\,288}{1\\,594\\,323}\\approx0{,}0014\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\approx0{,}00144\\)</p>",
