        "s": "<p>\\(x^3-x=x(x-1)(x+1)=0\\), alltså \\(x=-1\\), 0 eller 1.</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\{−1,\\ 0,\\ 1\\}\\)</p>",
