        "s": "<p>\\((3x+2)^6=64+576x+2\\,160x^2+\\dots\\)</p><p>\\(x^2\\)-termen i produkten: \\(1\\cdot2\\,160x^2+ax\\cdot576x\\). \\(2\\,160+576a=0\\iff a=-\\dfrac{15}{4}\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(a=-\\dfrac{15}{4}\\)</p>",
