        "s": "<p>\\((2+bx)^7=128+448bx+672b^2x^2+\\dots\\)</p><p>\\(672b^2=6\\cdot448b\\iff b=4\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(b=4\\)</p>",
