        "s": "<p>\\((1+bx)^{10}=1+10bx+45b^2x^2+120b^3x^3+\\dots\\)</p><p>\\(120b^3=2\\cdot45b^2\\iff b=\\dfrac34\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(b=\\dfrac34\\)</p>",
