        "s": "<p>\\(\\binom63\\cdot4^3\\left(-\\dfrac12\\right)^3=20\\cdot64\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac18\\right)=-160\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> −160</p>",
