        "s": "<p>\\((1+\\sqrt2)^5=1+5\\sqrt2+10\\cdot2+10\\cdot2\\sqrt2+5\\cdot4+4\\sqrt2=41+29\\sqrt2\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(a=41\\) (och \\(b=29\\))</p>",
