    "s": "<p>Summan ska vara en multipel av \\(\\text{MGM}(28,36,45)=2^2\\cdot3^2\\cdot5\\cdot7=1\\,260\\). Minsta talet: \\(1\\,260-19=1\\,241\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> 1 241</p>",
    "id": "2.660",
