        "s": "<p>\\(\\left[-\\dfrac{1}{3x^3}\\right]_1^b\\to\\dfrac13\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac13\\)</p>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Skriv integranden som \\(x^{-4}\\).</p>",
