        "s": "<p>Med \\(k=\\dfrac{20}{400\\cdot\\frac89}=0{,}05625\\): \\(y=\\dfrac{3\\,600}{1+8e^{-0{,}05625t}}\\).</p><p>\\(y(52)=\\dfrac{3\\,600}{1+8e^{-2{,}925}}\\approx2\\,520\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> cirka 2 520 individer</p>",
