        "s": "<p>\\(75v^{\\prime}=75g-15v\\iff v^{\\prime}=g-0{,}2v\\).</p><p>\\(v=\\dfrac{g}{0{,}2}\\left(1-e^{-0{,}2t}\\right)=49{,}1\\left(1-e^{-0{,}2t}\\right)\\) och \\(v(15)=49{,}1(1-e^{-3})\\approx47\\) m/s.</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> cirka 47 m/s</p>",
